choices(69,[('An independently excited stator winding, not one phase per visible rotor tooth.','Phase refers to an independent stator winding.'),('One phase for every rotor tooth, so the definition requires six phases.','Rotor tooth count is not winding phase count.'),('One phase for every visible stator pole, so every paired pole must be independent.','Opposite paired poles may belong to one phase winding.'),('One phase for each full mechanical revolution regardless of winding count.','A mechanical turn is not the phase definition.')])
